# Build context for images/workspace/Dockerfile and images/egress/Dockerfile is the repo root.
# Allowlist only what they copy.
*
!images/workspace/
!images/egress/
!packages/contracts/package.json
!packages/contracts/dist/
!packages/gateway/starter-skills/
!packages/sidecar/package.json
!packages/sidecar/dist/
**/node_modules
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.map
# Compiled tests. `tsc -b` puts *.test.js next to the code it tests, so dist/ carries the whole
# T0/T1 suite (and, through it, test fixtures) into the workspace image. Nothing in the container
# runs them; they are attack surface and image weight only.
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.d.ts
